    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Explain Arboreto input requirements for Pandas DataFrames and NumPy arrays.",
      "Guide GRN inference with GRNBoost2 and optional transcription factor lists.",
      "Compare GRNBoost2 and GENIE3 for speed, scale, and validation needs.",
      "Show reproducible workflows using seeds and clear output files.",
      "Describe local and distributed Dask execution for larger expression datasets.",
      "Interpret TF, target, and importance columns in network outputs."
